  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Maternal and Neonatal Health in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at building capacity in two universities in Malawi, Malawi University of Science and Technology (MUST) and University of Malawi, Kamuzu College of Nursing (KCN). There are also university partners in zambia and South Africa.  A focus will be on building capacity to develop and implement training programs in nursing, midwifery, medical microbiology, and obstetric ultrasound and to conduct world class research.</narrative>
  </description>
